diff --git a/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md b/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..a2a4756
--- /dev/null
+++ b/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+`order-triage`
+
+Classify each order for human review. Use `classify_order` with the order ID to determine whether its category is `fulfillment` or `refund-review`. Return the category and set `requiresHumanReview` to `true`.
+
+You cannot approve refunds. A `refund-review` classification only sends the order for human review.
